        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents I08-P7530-605, 3 House Number Address Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFinally, an easy to read address marker plate assembly for your office or house. The 3-3/4\" high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <b>Three (3) Numbers</b>. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/polished-brass-four-number-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7540-605\"><b>4 Number Address Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/five-number-address-plate-brass-accents-i08-p7550-605\"><b>5 Number Address Plate</b></a>. \r\n<br>\r\nSee all the <a href=\"/collections/numbers-and-letters\"><b>Brass Accents Address Number Plates</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3-house-address-plate-example.jpg?v=1704442266\" width=\"430\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents 3 House Number Address Plate Example\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents I08-P7530-605 3 House Number Address Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Number Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with 3 numbers, frame, back plate and mounting screws for easy installation. Assembled and Finished in the USA. Usually ships in one week.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBelow select your 3 address numbers in the order required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Three Number Polished Brass Address Plate Assembly, Brass Accents I08-P7530-605",
                "description": "Brass Accents I08-P7530-605 Polished Brass House Numbers -- For use with Three (3) Numbers. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. Finally a easy to read address marker plate assembly for your office or house. The 3-3/4 inch high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color. ",
